            "<p>Maharashtra is 3rd largest manganese producer in India</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Tiger Reserves</strong></p>",
            "<p>Melghat (Amravati), Tadoba-Andhari (Chandrapur), Sahyadri (Satara/Kolhapur), Navegaon-Nagzira (Gondia/Bhandara), Bor (Wardha), Pench (Nagpur)</p>"
